# Product registration order

Shop / Collection **최신등록순** sorts by `product.registeredAt` (ISO), newest first — every category and subcategory.

When adding products:

1. Set `registeredAt` to the registration time, e.g. `new Date().toISOString()` or an explicit ISO string.
2. Prefer appending new SKUs to the hand-authored catalogue (or any data module), not relying on array reverse.
3. Do not leave new products without `registeredAt` if they must appear above older stock.
4. Collection filler SKUs (`briq-col-*`) keep older dates on purpose — do not give them “now” timestamps.
